 * The fixed version tag mixed into every derived owner identifier (the member id's region code, the
 * household id and the identity key) to produce the version-2 identity. Because the tag is part of
 * each identifier's pre-image (or, for the member id, its literal region segment), no value produced
 * under version 1 is produced again. It is deliberately absent from the user-facing {@code locality},
 * {@code timezone} and owner-segment derivations, which continue to use the plain region code.
 */
String IDENTITY_VERSION_TAG = "V2";

/**
 * The identity API version carried by the owner response. Version 2 groups the identifiers under the
 * nested {@code identity} object and derives them with the {@link #IDENTITY_VERSION_TAG version-2
 * algorithm}.
 */
